: 4.0, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "one-third of readers", "x": 56.82, "y": 21.28, "w": 12.51, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "(31,730) reported secretly fearing", "x": 52.91, "y": 22.51, "w": 20.07, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "being accosted or kidnapped if they", "x": 52.88, "y": 23.75, "w": 21.04, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "did not constantly monitor their sur-", "x": 52.85, "y": 24.99, "w": 20.91, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "roundings. Abductees are appre-", "x": 52.88, "y": 26.23, "w": 19.07, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "hensive in situations where other", "x": 52.88, "y": 27.47, "w": 19.58, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "people are not. Abductees are", "x": 52.88, "y": 28.71, "w": 17.79, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "reluctant to let down their guard", "x": 52.88, "y": 29.94, "w": 19.03, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "and typically find themselves in", "x": 52.88, "y": 31.18, "w": 18.69, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "areas where they feel they must", "x": 52.88, "y": 32.42, "w": 19.08, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "remain hyper-vigilant for security", "x": 52.88, "y": 33.66, "w": 19.69, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "reasons. While most abductees do", "x": 52.88, "y": 34.9, "w": 20.49, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "not have any concrete reasons to", "x": 52.88, "y": 36.13, "w": 19.72, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "carry on this way, their behavior is", "x": 52.85, "y": 37.37, "w": 20.49, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "persistent and permanent in this", "x": 52.88, "y": 38.61, "w": 19.21, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "direction. Old habits are difficult to", "x": 52.85, "y": 39.85, "w": 20.43, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "break, and abductees are overly", "x": 52.88, "y": 41.09, "w": 19.08, "h": 1.03, "fontSize": 7.7}, {"text": "sensitive to any intrusion into their", "x": 52.85, "y": 42.33, "w": 20.41, "h"